ext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">None</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">FTE Hours:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"></span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">1.00</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Reports to:</span></b></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">General Counsel/Vice President</span></p></td></tr><tr><td width=\"155\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:116.6pt; border:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-top:none; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Job Description Status:</span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></p></td><td width=\"396\" valign=\"top\" style=\"width:297.0pt; border-top:none; border-left:none; border-bottom:solid windowtext 1.0pt; border-right:solid windowtext 1.0pt; padding:0in 5.4pt 0in 5.4pt\"><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">In progress, information for posting is below</span></p></td></tr></tbody></table><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Position Summary:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-left:0in\"><span lang=\"EN\" style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Open Sans&quot;,sans-serif\">The Chief Compliance Officer (CCO) provides strategic leadership and oversight of TidalHealth’s compliance program, ensuring adherence to all applicable healthcare laws, regulations, and accreditation standards. Reporting to the Vice President and General Counsel, the CCO promotes a culture of integrity while proactively identifying and mitigating regulatory and operational risk. This role partners with executive and clinical leadership to ensure effective governance, regulatory compliance, education, monitoring, and continuous improvement across the organization.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></b></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Education:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Master’s Degree in Healthcare/Nursing/Business Administration or Organizational Development required.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"margin-left:.5in; line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">License and/or certification::</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in\">Certified as a CHC (Certified in Healthcare Compliance) is required within one year from date of hire or transfer into role. </li><li class=\"MsoListParagraph\" style=\"margin-bottom:12.0pt; margin-left:0in\">CHPC (Certified in Healthcare Privacy Compliance or CCEP (Certified Compliance &amp; Ethics Professional) is preferred.<b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\"> </span></b></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Experience:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">At least ten (10) years of progressive healthcare management experience up to the Senior Director leadership level.</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; line-height:115%\"></span><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%\"></span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Schedule:</span></b></p><ul type=\"disc\" style=\"margin-top:0in\"><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Primarily day shift, Monday through Friday</span></li><li class=\"MsoNormal\" style=\"line-height:115%\"><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; line-height:115%; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif\">Evenings and weekends may be required as needed.</span></li></ul><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b>TA:</b> Please let hiring managers know what their next steps are for posting. We are actively pulling market data for this role, but did not want to hold up the posting, </p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">Thank you!</p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Filippa Etherton, SHRM-SCP<br></span></b><span style=\"font-size:10.0pt; font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif; color:#003A70\">Compensation Manager<br>People Department<br><b>TidalHealth<br>O </b>410-912-6744<br>mytidalhealth.org</span><span style=\"font-size:11.0pt; font-family:&quot;Segoe Script&quot;\"></span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Calibri&quot;,sans-serif\">&nbsp;</span></p><p class=\"MsoNormal\">&nbsp;</p></div></body></html>","bodyType":"html"}